Food Delivery Customer Churn & Order Analytics —> 8,000 Customers
What is this?
A fully synthetic food-delivery app dataset with 8,000 customers and 30 clean features.
Includes demographics, plan type, engagement metrics, delivery experience, support interactions, payments, and a clear binary churn target.

Why should you use it?
Clean, complete data — zero missing values
Defined target — churned (1 = churned, 0 = retained)
Realistic distributions — Indian market flavor (cities, UPI, cuisines, INR values)
Multiple tasks — classification, regression, segmentation, feature importance, BI
Universal appeal — food delivery is something almost everyone understands
Current churn rate: 26.3%

